{"name":"Porch shoe storage and bench, Palmers Green (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (9 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (nothing measured): porch 1400 wide inside, 2400 high, with the hall doorway in the end wall. Left wall: tall cupboard 760 x 318 x 2150, two panelled doors (12 mm board with a 6 mm frame, three panels each: short, middle, tall), five shelves. Right wall, from the hall door: shoe cupboard 450 wide, one panelled door, 13 shoe shelves; then a bench 900 long, seat at 450, with a two-panel front; vertical MDF boards on the wall behind the bench up to 2150. All 18 mm MDF with 18 mm backs. The hall-door wall is room context; the two side walls were drawn in SketchUp but are left out of the web model so both sides of the porch can be seen. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X across the porch, Y from the entrance towards the hall door, Z up.","materials":{"MDF 18 mm":{"color":[200,172,142],"roughness":0.85},"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95}},"moves":{"Tall cupboard: Door, left (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[318,-858.5,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":60},"at":[0,0.5],"with":["Tall cupboard: Door, left (hinged left): frame"]},"Tall cupboard: Door, right (hinged right)":{"hinge":{"origin":[318,-101.5,0],"axis":[0,0,1],"angle":70},"at":[0.08,0.55],"with":["Tall cupboard: Door, right (hinged right): frame"]},"Shoe cupboard: Door (hinged left)":{"hinge":{"origin":[1082,-101.5,0],"axis":[0,0,-1],"angle":95},"at":[0.25,0.8],"with":["Shoe cupboard: Door (hinged left): frame"]}},"view":{"yaw":-0.75,"pitch":0.3,"yawMin":-1.25,"yawMax":1.25,"pitchMin":-0.05,"pitchMax":1.0},"actions":{"open":"Open the doors","close":"Close the doors"},"secs":2.2,"apart":["Tall cupboard","Shoe cupboard","Bench seat","Panelling"],"geoms":{"g0":{"v":[300,-860,0,0,-860,0,0,-842,0,300,-842,0,300,-860,2150,300,-842,2150,0,-842,2150,0,-860,2150],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]],[[4,5,6,7]],[[0,3,5,4]],[[3,2,6,5]],[[2,